  "thig1.18:1.1": "hitvā ghare pabbajitvā ",
  "thig1.18:1.2": "hitvā puttaṃ pasuṃ piyaṃ ",
  "thig1.18:1.3": "hitvā rāgañca dosañca ",
  "thig1.18:1.4": "avijjañca virājiya ",
  "thig1.18:1.5": "samūlaṃ taṇhaṃ abbuyha ",
  "thig1.18:1.6": "upasantamhi nibbutā. ",
  "thig1.18:2.1": "saṅghā. ekikā ",
  "thig1.18:3.1": "theriyo samattā. therīgāthāya dukanipāto 1 "
